<title>OMAN: OMAN UNITED INSURANCE POSTS HIGHER H1 NET.</title>
<headline>OMAN UNITED INSURANCE POSTS HIGHER H1 NET.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman United Insurance Co posted a net profit of 943,797 rials ($2.5 million) in the first half of 1997 from 777,942 in the year-ago period, the official Oman News Agency (ONA) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company posted a full-year 1996 net profit of 1.02 million rials, up from 870,000 in 1995. ($1=0.377 rials)</p>
</text>
